lassName":"font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"Does SEO still matter with AI search?"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-mono text-body text-fg-secondary","children":"Yes — more than ever, just differently. AI engines pull from the web they crawl and trust, so strong SEO foundations feed GEO. The shift: optimize to be the cited source, not only the #1 link."}]]}]]}]]}]
