22:["$","$L3a",null,{"faqs":[{"question":"What is generative engine optimization (GEO)?","answer":"GEO is the practice of optimizing your content and brand so AI search engines — ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Gemini — cite you as a source in their answers. As AI answers replace blue links, GEO makes your brand the answer the AI quotes, not just a link on page one."},{"question":"What is answer engine optimization (AEO)?","answer":"AEO optimizes your content to win the direct answer — the featured snippet, the answer box, and the spoken/AI response to a question. It structures your pages so a single, extractable answer earns the spot, which also feeds GEO citations."},{"question":"GEO vs SEO vs AEO — what's the difference?","answer":"SEO ranks you in the classic blue links. AEO wins the featured answer box. GEO gets you cited inside AI-generated answers (ChatGPT, Perplexity, AI Overviews). They build on each other — strong SEO and AEO feed GEO — and we run all three as one strategy."},{"question":"How do I rank on ChatGPT — and get cited by Perplexity or Google AI Overviews?","answer":"You make your content the kind of source AI engines retrieve and trust: clear, extractable answers; schema and entity signals; authority and citations; and a structure the models can quote. We audit where you stand, fix the gaps, and publish AI-citation content — then measure your share of AI answers."},{"question":"Does SEO still matter in the age of AI search?","answer":"Yes — more than ever. AI engines pull from the web they crawl and trust, so strong SEO foundations directly feed GEO. The shift isn't SEO vs GEO; it's adding GEO and AEO on top of SEO so you're ranked AND cited."},{"question":"How much does GEO cost, and do you measure AI citations?","answer":"GEO cost depends on scope. We work three ways — a monthly GEO retainer, a one-time GEO audit and roadmap, or a GEO + SEO bundle — with senior nearshore talent from $50 USD an hour, a fraction of a US agency. And yes: we measure your AI citations and share of AI answers, so GEO is accountable, not a black box."}],"id":"faq","title":"What teams ask about getting cited by AI.","fill":true}]
23:["$","section",null,{"data-reveal":true,"className":"border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Related services"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"Often paired with GEO & AEO"}],["$","ul",null,{"data-reveal-stagger":true,"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4","children":[["$","li","seo",{"children":"$L3b"}],["$","li","ai-agent-development",{"children":"$L3c"}],["$","li","web-development",{"children":"$L3d"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-20 font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Learn more"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 font-display text-display-m font-bold text-fg","children":"From the blog"}],["$","$L3e",null,{"posts":[{"title":"Why isn't my business showing up in ChatGPT? (and how to fix it)","slug":"why-isnt-my-business-showing-up-in-chatgpt","category":"AI","excerpt":"You ask ChatGPT about your industry and you're not there. Usually it's because your content isn't structured for AI to extract and cite. Here's why it happens, how to check how bad it is, and what to do so ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Gemini mention you.","readMin":7,"date":"Jul 2026","image":"/blog/covers/not-showing-up-in-chatgpt.webp","imageAlt":"A person asks ChatGPT for a business in their industry and the answer cites competitors, not their company"},{"title":"AI Visibility Index 2026: we tested 65 Mexican companies","slug":"ai-visibility-index-mexico-2026","category":"Insight","excerpt":"We audited 65 of Mexico's largest companies for AI search citability. The average score was 47/100, and not a single one had FAQ schema. The surprise: they aren't blocking AI crawlers — 98% let them in. They're just handing them a blank page.","readMin":7,"date":"Jul 2026","image":"/blog/covers/ai-visibility-index-mexico.webp","imageAlt":"AI Visibility Index 2026 — a minimal bar chart showing how few Mexican companies are citable by AI search engines"},{"title":"Best GEO tools and platforms (2026)","slug":"best-geo-tools-2026","category":"AI","excerpt":"A category-by-category roundup of the best GEO tools and platforms in 2026 — AI citation tracking, AEO content optimization, entity and schema tooling, classic SEO suites adding GEO, and answer monitoring. Organized by job, with what each is best for and the catch.","readMin":9,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/best-geo-tools-2026.webp","imageAlt":"Logos of ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude, the best GEO tools for 2026"},{"title":"Does SEO still matter in the age of AI search?","slug":"does-seo-still-matter-ai-search","category":"AI","excerpt":"Is SEO dead now that AI Overviews and chatbots answer the question for you? No — SEO still matters, it's just necessary-not-sufficient. AI engines pull from the same web SEO makes you visible on, so GEO and AEO stack on top of SEO; they don't delete it. Here's what actually changed and how to adapt.","readMin":8,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/does-seo-still-matter-ai-search.webp","imageAlt":"A content strategist working on a laptop, exploring whether SEO still matters in the age of AI search"},{"title":"GEO vs SEO vs AEO: what's the difference?","slug":"geo-vs-seo-vs-aeo","category":"AI","excerpt":"GEO vs SEO vs AEO, explained without the hype. SEO wins rankings on classic search, AEO wins the direct answer slot, and GEO wins citations inside AI-generated answers — here's how they differ, where they overlap, and why you run all three together.","readMin":7,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/geo-vs-seo-vs-aeo.webp","imageAlt":"Three cards labeled SEO, GEO and AEO, comparing the three optimization disciplines"},{"title":"How to get cited by Perplexity and Google AI Overviews","slug":"how-to-get-cited-perplexity-ai-overviews","category":"AI","excerpt":"How to get cited by Perplexity and Google AI Overviews, step by step. Both reward authoritative, well-structured, extractable content that already has visibility — here's how citation works in each, where they differ, and the six moves that earn the link.","readMin":8,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/how-to-get-cited-perplexity-ai-overviews.webp","imageAlt":"Perplexity and Google logos, illustrating how to get cited by Perplexity and Google AI Overviews"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
